      "timestamp_granularity_finding": {
        "headline": "CRITICAL, CONFIRMED ACROSS BOTH FILES BY FULL SCAN: for our 3 target tickers, 99.66-99.78% of nasdaq_exteral_data.csv timestamps (and 97.9-99.7% of All_external.csv's) are truncated/defaulted to exactly 00:00:00 UTC. Real intraday timestamps: ~25-31 rows per ticker across all of 2018-2023, out of 9,000-11,700 total rows per ticker.",
        "all_external_csv_full_scan_AAPL_NVDA_TSLA": {
